  "body": "Designed for effortless living and entertaining, this beautifully maintained residence delivers an impressive combination of space, sun and contemporary style in the heart of Orakei.\r\n\r\nSet across three thoughtfully designed levels, the home feels wonderfully private and peaceful, with generous proportions and an abundance of natural light throughout. Warm timber flooring complements the refined, neutral interiors, creating a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere that feels immediately inviting.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed kitchen featuring quality appliances, excellent storage and a generous scullery. It connects seamlessly with the open-plan dining and living area, while a recently added outdoor louvre system creates an expansive outdoor living area designed to be enjoyed year-round. Complete with a built-in BBQ and gas fire, it's an ideal setting for everything from relaxed evenings at home to entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nFour well-proportioned bedrooms with built-in wardrobes (including dual walk-in wardrobes in the master) provide excellent accommodation, complemented by two generous bathrooms and an additional powder room, while a second, separate living space provides valuable flexibility for families.\r\n\r\nPracticality has been equally well considered, with a double internal-access garage, dedicated laundry, solar panels and Tesla battery, excellent storage throughout and additional off-street parking for guests.\r\n\r\nPrivate, exceptionally well presented and designed for an easy-care lifestyle plus walking distance to Okahu Bay, parks and Bastion Point - this is a home that brings together all the ingredients buyers seek in the Bays - quality, space, sunshine and superb indoor-outdoor living.",
